<title>USA: Appliance Recycling Centers joins Nasdaq SmallCap.</title>
<headline>Appliance Recycling Centers joins Nasdaq SmallCap.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Appliance Recycling Centers of America Inc said Tuesday its shares will begin trading on the Nasdaq SmallCap Market February 26.</p>
<p>Under the symbol ARCID, the shares previously traded on the Nasdaq National Market, the company said.</p>
<p>Aluminum Recycling Centers provides household appliance recycling services and a range of collection, recycling and reuse services.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
